uses separate prompt sets that were not ported. When a pull request is
described in several parts, each part's prompt gets one line (.part_header,
the fixed sentence of PartHeader) right before the diff, telling the model
which part it sees. With one part nothing is rendered, so the prompt is
byte-identical to the one without the feature.
